# TZ-232 Wave 2 — DONE ✅

## Outcome

5 list-pages migrated to the canonical `<pi-entity-list>` shell (pattern established in Wave 3 — organizations.page.ts).

| Page | Before | After | Δ | Endpoint | Server sortBy |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| materials | 482 | 127 | **−355 (−74%)** | /api/materials | off |
| products | 475 | 170 | **−305 (−64%)** | /api/products | on (backend) |
| work-types | 340 | 133 | **−207 (−61%)** | /api/work-types | off |
| modules | 523 | 169 | **−354 (−68%)** | /api/product-modules | off |
| tables (table-templates) | 533 | 142 | **−391 (−73%)** | /api/table-templates | off |
| **TOTAL** | **2353** | **741** | **−1612 (−69%)** | | |

Net **−1612 lines** (~69% reduction) across 5 pages. Every page now follows the same shape:

```
template  → <app-pi-entity-list endpoint="" [columns]="" ... [rowActions]="rowActionsTpl" (create)="openCreate()">
class     → injects (service/dialog/toast/destroyRef/injector) + cols + openCreate/openEdit/onDelete
```

## New file

